  "description": "Managed scalar-field arithmetic backends for Lumoin.Veridical: the BigInteger reference backends and the per-ISA SIMD backends (AVX2, AVX-512, NEON) behind the curve scalar delegates, plus the dispatch facade that picks the fastest available implementation. Additional accelerator backends land here.",
